&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci2.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=6240843&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17463120" author="ivandasch" created="Tue, 21 Dec 2021 10:39:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=RyzhovSV&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;RyzhovSV&quot;&gt;RyzhovSV&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sdarlington&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sdarlington&quot;&gt;sdarlington&lt;/a&gt; Ignite zookeper depends on curator framework and use good ole log4j 1.2.17. Removing log4j here is not an option. And I don&apos;t understand why, because nothing related with log4j 2 hysteria&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17463152" author="ivandasch" created="Tue, 21 Dec 2021 10:53:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Also, if we want to remove all log4j 1.2.17, we should also remove completely &lt;tt&gt;ignite-log4j&lt;/tt&gt; module and log4j 1.x support&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
