                            <comment id="17464058" author="ryzhovsv" created="Wed, 22 Dec 2021 21:01:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;If we removed these libs,  stdout  will be contained&lt;br/&gt;
2021-12-22 22:47:43.916:INFO::main: Logging initialized @2598ms to org.eclipse.jetty.util.log.StdErrLog&lt;br/&gt;
